7-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-21T13:21:06Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T13:25:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122694","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122694.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122694.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This MR uses the `wl_fixes` global to properly destroy the `wl_registry` object. While this is a correctness fix, and doesn't really have a concrete benefit, it's also a preparation for implementing `wl_fixes` v2, which [does fix a real issue](https://blog.vladzahorodnii.com/2026/03/24/addressing-global-removal-race-in-wayland/).\r\n\r\nThe first commit updates the Wayland headers and dynwrappers to 1.24.0. (The protocol XML itself was already updated in #113733.)\r\nThe second commit binds the `wl_fixes` global, and the third one uses it to call `wl_fixes_destroy_registry`.\r\n\r\nUpdating the headers and dynwrappers doesn't seem to increase the runtime version of libwayland-client. I tested this MR in a Debian 13 and a Debian 12 container, and both worked, despite having only Wayland 1.23.1 and 1.21.0, respectively.\r\nThe latter does print a few dlsym errors when so_wrap is used because it lacks some functions from newer versions of libwayland-client, but that should be OK, since we don't actually use them. The entire `wl_fixes` implementation is on the header side and doesn't require any new symbols, so it works even on very old libwayland-client versions.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122694/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122694/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}